    "detailed_description": "This concise experience has striking visuals &amp; screenshot candy. <br>As an immersive sim and streamlined walking simulator, quest on your Holy Journey to Ascend in the Holy Chamber! <br>Holy Journey of Salvation is a short FPS Walking Simulator with Cinematic moments &amp; Immersive Sim vibes. As the player, you will solve puzzles using Mythical interpretations of Chemistry &amp; Combat to fight Enemies.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Spiritualization of Chemistry</h2>Worship the Holy Spirits like Xyjuh and Coh Toh as they help you overcome your obstacles. <br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1993730/extras/28e2861ca8881ef18813e2825cdec4f0.poster.avif?t=1712247807\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1993730/extras/28e2861ca8881ef18813e2825cdec4f0.webm?t=1712247807\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1993730/extras/28e2861ca8881ef18813e2825cdec4f0.mp4?t=1712247807\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Realistic Inspired Chemical Reactions</h2>Do you have a good understanding of Chemistry? <br>Great! You'll <strong>LOVE</strong> how your real chemistry understanding is applied in this casual Immersive experience with suspension of reality. <br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1993730/extras/8f494ab67cfc124a1e14b252ba6d3b81.poster.avif?t=1712247807\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1993730/extras/8f494ab67cfc124a1e14b252ba6d3b81.webm?t=1712247807\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1993730/extras/8f494ab67cfc124a1e14b252ba6d3b81.mp4?t=1712247807\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Concise Experience</h2>Not everyone has hours to pour into a game. This concise experience is masterfully crafted to allow people with busy schedules to have a completable experience in less time than it would take to watch a movie.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Great Graphics, Not hard to run!</h2>The target system is a low powered APU system, so if you have an older PC, or a Steam Deck, you'll be able to play this game no problem! <br>Plus, with the high quality AAA quality graphics, it'll look fantastic! <br>You don't have to compromise. <br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1993730/extras/70e36d9b54968ae5b95596f689dcd7de.avif?t=1712247807\" /></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Deep Themes</h2>Are you an analytic movie viewer?<br>See if you can find all the hidden story themes this game has to offer. See what the game means to <i>you</i>.",
    "about_the_game": "This concise experience has striking visuals &amp; screenshot candy. <br>As an immersive sim and streamlined walking simulator, quest on your Holy Journey to Ascend in the Holy Chamber! <br>Holy Journey of Salvation is a short FPS Walking Simulator with Cinematic moments &amp; Immersive Sim vibes. As the player, you will solve puzzles using Mythical interpretations of Chemistry &amp; Combat to fight Enemies.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Spiritualization of Chemistry</h2>Worship the Holy Spirits like Xyjuh and Coh Toh as they help you overcome your obstacles. <br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1993730/extras/28e2861ca8881ef18813e2825cdec4f0.poster.avif?t=1712247807\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1993730/extras/28e2861ca8881ef18813e2825cdec4f0.webm?t=1712247807\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1993730/extras/28e2861ca8881ef18813e2825cdec4f0.mp4?t=1712247807\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Realistic Inspired Chemical Reactions</h2>Do you have a good understanding of Chemistry? <br>Great! You'll <strong>LOVE</strong> how your real chemistry understanding is applied in this casual Immersive experience with suspension of reality. <br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1993730/extras/8f494ab67cfc124a1e14b252ba6d3b81.poster.avif?t=1712247807\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1993730/extras/8f494ab67cfc124a1e14b252ba6d3b81.webm?t=1712247807\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1993730/extras/8f494ab67cfc124a1e14b252ba6d3b81.mp4?t=1712247807\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Concise Experience</h2>Not everyone has hours to pour into a game. This concise experience is masterfully crafted to allow people with busy schedules to have a completable experience in less time than it would take to watch a movie.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Great Graphics, Not hard to run!</h2>The target system is a low powered APU system, so if you have an older PC, or a Steam Deck, you'll be able to play this game no problem! <br>Plus, with the high quality AAA quality graphics, it'll look fantastic! <br>You don't have to compromise. <br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1993730/extras/70e36d9b54968ae5b95596f689dcd7de.avif?t=1712247807\" /></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Deep Themes</h2>Are you an analytic movie viewer?<br>See if you can find all the hidden story themes this game has to offer. See what the game means to <i>you</i>.",
